# Workspace artifacts (never committed to dev repo root)
# Anchored to the repo root on purpose: unanchored `.scripts/` also matched
# `skills/init-workspace/assets/.scripts/` and silently dropped those files from
# every release zipball (new modules never got committed → shipped asset tree
# imported modules that did not exist). See docs/release.md release contents.
